{
  "title": "Colors, describing things and agreement",
  "note": "Adjectives usually follow the noun and agree with it. Adjectives in -o have four forms (rosso, rossa, rossi, rosse); adjectives in -e have two (verde, verdi). A few colors never change: blu, rosa, viola.",
  "src": { "t": "D'accordo!, Grammatica I: accordo del nome", "u": "https://human.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/Languages/Italian/D'accordo_-_Intermediate_Italian_(Blum_and_Gemmani)" },
